%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6b150d71335989a41acd6479095b721b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sephiroth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  entries:
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Where- where is this...?
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Benevolent One
    text: H-Hey... all four of you need to get out of there, NOW!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Rio
    text: What're you on about, man?! Why're you so scared all of a sudden?! Ain't
      you a god?!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Benevolent One
    text: S-Seriously...! ALL OF YOU NEED TO GO, RIGHT N-
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Sephiroth
    text: So I was correct. This is not the world that I originate from. Not in the
      slightest.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Maya
    text: Urk- Wh-Who is that...?! Their magic... it's so oppressive, I'm struggling
      to stand...!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Benevolent One
    text: He found us... damn it all. All of you need to stand ready for battle,
      right now.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kiri
    text: W-Who is he?!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: He feels... so much different from anyone else we've managed to defeat
      thus far. He's- a whole different type of beast.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Benevolent One
    text: In a world where memories flow as would a river... he took form.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Benevolent One
    text: First as a war hero, then as the personification of despair itself.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Benevolent One
    text: ...His name is Sephiroth.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Sephiroth
    text: ...Your awareness of me is flattering.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Sephiroth
    text: Show me your strength, all of you...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Sephiroth
    text: If you wish to see your journey, your battle for your right to exist, to
      its completion...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Sephiroth
    text: Then strike me down where I stand.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
